WEBVTT

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:31.767
bukan, "Pergi," tapi,

00:10:31.791 --> 00:10:34.608
"Tidak apa-apa, kami melindungimu, 
kalian aman."

00:10:35.112 --> 00:10:36.275
Terima kasih.

00:10:36.299 --> 00:10:39.124
(Tepuk tangan)

00:10:39.148 --> 00:10:40.354
Terima kasih.

00:10:40.378 --> 00:10:41.739
(Tepuk tangan)